{"version":1,"content":"<p>Canonical正在為Ubuntu作業系統推進一項重要的安全基礎設施升級。隨着今年10月發佈的Ubuntu 26.10正式上線，一項此前較少受到關注的新功能已經開始部署，那就是基於upki項目的證書吊銷校驗支持。這項技術旨在讓整個Linux系統具備接近現代瀏覽器級別的證書驗證和安全防護能力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585880.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.475233+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:04:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_hash":"32fffef45b3b78795af88a29ff7607a63b2c577247de5c59c9938ed6897dbdae","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}